<body>
    <h1>Platform Usage</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h2 id=3D"PlatformUsage-NBINataglance(estimates)">NBIN at a glance =
(estimates)</h2>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" width=
=3D"468" src=3D"df8382cac3215630107624bce358dd76449b114830bc5cb558237d3714b=
266eb" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/934841296/image-2025-10-21_2=
2-57-2-1.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1761101823093&amp;api=3Dv2"=
 data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"2440764476"=
 data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment=
" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-2025-10-21_22-57-2-1.png" dat=
a-base-url=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"ima=
ge/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"934841296" data-linked-resourc=
e-container-version=3D"12" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D"" height=3D"52"></span></p=
>
<h2 id=3D"PlatformUsage-UserBase(asofMay2021)">User Base (as of May 2021)</=
h2>
<p>Total users (across 437 firms):</p>
<ul>
 <li>IB: 2888</li>
 <li>PM: 2097</li>
 <li>IFM: 124</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Compass R2</strong></p>
<ul>
 <li>Total users ~7000</li>
 <li>Total end clients ~964,000</li>
 <li>Total end client accounts ~1.3m</li>
</ul>
<p>Total RR codes ~18000</p>
<ul>
 <li>Distribution amongst firms=20
  <ul>
   <li>&gt; 80% of PM firms have &lt;10 RR codes</li>
   <li>&gt; 80% of IB firms have &lt; 37 RR codes</li>
  </ul></li>
 <li>Distribution amongst users=20
  <ul>
   <li>&gt; 90% of users have &lt; 26 RR codes; 75% have 10 or less</li>
  </ul></li>
 <li>Distribution of clients &amp; accounts=20
  <ul>
   <li>&gt; 99% of RR codes have &gt;1000 accounts; per above majority of u=
sers have many RR codes and we assume certain roles support many RR codes</=
li>
   <li>Roughly 50% of RR codes have &lt; 20 clients</li>
   <li>Note on a number of RR codes with only 1 "client": some firms looked=
 for a "special RR code" to manage one type of client / product / some spec=
ific edge case, instead of using other methods to identify those accounts</=
li>
  </ul></li>
</ul>
<p>End client:</p>
<ul>
 <li>More than 85% end clients have &lt;25&nbsp;holdings in their accounts<=
/li>
</ul>
<p><strong>NetRep:</strong></p>
<ul>
 <li>IB's: 56 firms, 2435 ID's</li>
 <li>PM's: 316 firms, 1772 ID's (mostly trading)</li>
 <li>
  <p class=3D"with-breadcrumbs"><a href=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca/pages/viewpa=
ge.action?pageId=3D1001600021" rel=3D"nofollow">NETREP User Access / Tradin=
g Access by Products</a></p></li>
</ul>
<p>Usage</p>
<ul>
 <li>15% are mobile</li>
 <li>most are average resolution</li>
</ul>
<h2 id=3D"PlatformUsage-UserForecast">User Forecast</h2>
<p>PM:</p>
<ul>
 <li>Estimated # of staff across firms: ~5500</li>
 <li>Largest firms: ~200 staff</li>
 <li>% client services / operations staff in firm: roughly 10 - 20%&nbsp;:q=
uestion:</li>
</ul>
<p>IB:</p>
<ul>
 <li>Estimated # of staff across firms: ~4500</li>
 <li>Largest firms: ~1000 staff</li>
</ul>
    </div>
</body>
